<title>RUSSIA: Russian GDP rises 0.1 pct yr/yr in Jan.</title>
<headline>Russian GDP rises 0.1 pct yr/yr in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian gross domestic product in January totalled 201 trillion roubles, which was 0.1 percent more than a year earlier in inflation-adjusted terms, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN GDP			  JAN 97    DEC 96    JAN 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	 -12	  +4	 -16</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +0.1	-4	  -3</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
